\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Step A:
\f0\b0  Drops the older active flag: 
\fs30 \cf3 \cb4 \strokec3 UPDATE upload_details SET is_active_snapshot = FALSE WHERE customer_id = ? AND is_active_snapshot = TRUE;
\fs24 \cf2 \cb1 \strokec2 \
